SUMMARY:Horse Trek – Eastbound
LOCATION:Virtual\, Oregon
DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 122999\n\nHorsemanship\n\nEmbark on the Horseback Ride of a Lifetime\nSad
 dle up for an unforgettable ten-day journey across 165 miles of breathtak
 ing wilderness! Join fellow Scouts as you ride through the majestic Mt. H
 ood Wilderness\, learning the art of horse-packing\, wilderness survival\
 , and soaking in cowboy tales from Head Wrangler Daniel Lawson and his te
 am of experienced wranglers. Each day brings new adventures\, from trail 
 riding to chuck wagon-style meals\, with nights spent under the stars (or
  your tent) as cricke
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-122999
END:VEVENT
