DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 pioneer27\n\nEngineering\, Inventing\, Robotics\n\nCamp Pioneer\nFor Scou
 ts. By Scouts.\nPioneer is where the ordinary ends and the epic begins. W
 hether you’re questing through immersive roleplay or trekking across vo
 lcanic ridgelines\, every path leads to personal growth. It’s a place w
 here you’ll crawl through frigid ice caves\, summit mountain peaks\, 
 or spend hours strategizing around a tabletop—and somehow\, it all bui
 lds the same Scout skills: teamwork\, resilience\, and leadership. At Cam
 p Pioneer\, you don’t just attend camp—you live the adventur
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-pioneer27
END:VEVENT
