SUMMARY:Camp Baldwin - Summer Camp Scouts BSA – Session 1
LOCATION:Camp Baldwin\, Dufur\, Oregon
DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 baldwin27\n\nWhitewater\n\nCamp Baldwin\nBuilt on Grit. Defined by Advent
 ure.\nRenowned as the pride of the CPC\, Camp Baldwin is the ultimate hig
 h-adventure destination for Scouts. Tucked deep in the Mt. Hood National 
 Forest\, this rugged camp delivers non-stop outdoor action — from horse
 back riding\, mountain biking\, and rock climbing to whitewater rafting\,
  and more. Surrounded by towering evergreens and roaming wildlife\, Baldw
 in is where you push limits\, build skills\, and create stories worth tel
 ling.\nLearn More on Our Webs
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-baldwin27
END:VEVENT
