SUMMARY:Camp Baldwin Summer Camp 2028 – Session 1
LOCATION:Camp Baldwin\, Dufur\, Oregon
DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 123000\n\nWhitewater\n\nCamp Baldwin\nBuilt on Grit. Defined by Adventure
 .\nRenowned as the pride of the CPC\, Camp Baldwin is the ultimate high-a
 dventure destination for Scouts. Tucked deep in the Mt. Hood National For
 est\, this rugged camp delivers non-stop outdoor action — from horsebac
 k riding\, mountain biking\, and rock climbing to whitewater rafting\, an
 d more. Surrounded by towering evergreens and roaming wildlife\, Baldwin 
 is where you push limits\, build skills\, and create stories worth tellin
 g.\nLearn More on Our Webs
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-123000
END:VEVENT
